{"xson":[{"/iati-activities/iati-activity":[{"/activity-date":[{"@iso-date":"2007-09-12","@type":"2"},{"@iso-date":"2019-04-03","@type":"4"}],"/activity-status@code":"4","/collaboration-type@code":"2","/contact-info":[{"/organisation/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/person-name/narrative":[{"1":"Toure, Abdoulaye","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/telephone":[{"1":"+390654591"}],"/website":[{"1":"http://www.ifad.org"}],"@type":"1"}],"/default-aid-type":[{"@code":"C01","@vocabulary":"1"}],"/default-tied-status@code":"5","/description":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"Key project objectives:The overall objective is to reduce rural poverty by improving the incomes and living conditions of the target group, particularly through the valorisation of natural resources and their sustainable management. The specific aim is to enable target group members to become major players in building the social fabric of their communities and to strengthen their capacity to establish their priority goals and then develop economic and social initiatives to realize them.Policy and institutional objectives:The key focus of the project is on building the rural institutions of and for the target group. The project aims to build a pluralistic local governance system, which will involve the community through new and effective forms of partnership, and which will link the rural poor of Quinara and Tombali regions to local public administration, NGOs and the private sector.","@xml:lang":"EN"}]}],"/document-link":[{"/category":[{"@code":"A12"}],"/description/narrative":[{"1":"More information on how IFAD publish IATI data to ensure the effectiveness of development.","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"IATI documentation on IFAD corporate website","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"TEXT/HTML","@url":"/en/iati"},{"/category":[{"@code":"A12"}],"/description/narrative":[{"1":"The IFAD website includes a specific page for this project.  Mo